        <mxCell id="U-Jg9Jrtenf92Qa0-zKH-75" edge="1" parent="1" source="U-Jg9Jrtenf92Qa0-zKH-38" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#16212b;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=0;exitY=0.95;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" target="U-Jg9Jrtenf92Qa0-zKH-43" value="tap [Retry failed]: new priced&lt;br&gt;run, failed poses only">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="U-Jg9Jrtenf92Qa0-zKH-76" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#eef3fb;strokeColor=#3b5b8c;dashed=1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=4;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;" value="&lt;b&gt;Exit&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Type MENU (or restart · cancel · exit · quit · back · hi · hello) at any step: the catalogue is dropped and the main menu is shown. The photo prompt has an [Exit] button and the guess a [Menu] button; the lists do not&lt;br&gt;The menu buttons (credits, help, new) work from any old message&lt;br&gt;Not while a catalogue is generating (see Generating lock)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="150" width="330" x="3530" y="4060" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="U-Jg9Jrtenf92Qa0-zKH-77" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#eef3fb;strokeColor=#3b5b8c;dashed=1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=4;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;" value="&lt;b&gt;Step lock&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Question steps (gender, guess, alternatives, garment type, pose count, no credits): a photo, or a New catalogue tap from an old message, is refused with &quot;You&#39;re in the middle of a catalogue. Type MENU to start over.&quot; and the step is shown again, everything chosen kept&lt;br&gt;Menu, photo prompt, delivered: a photo starts a new catalogue (gender first)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="180" width="330" x="4070" y="4060" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="U-Jg9Jrtenf92Qa0-zKH-78" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#eef3fb;strokeColor=#3b5b8c;dashed=1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=4;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;" value="&lt;b&gt;Also in every step&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;stray text or a tap of an old button: the current step is shown again, no error line&lt;br&gt;credits / help (typed or button): answered in place, the step is kept&lt;br&gt;video or document: &quot;Please send a photo (JPG or PNG), not a video or document.&quot;&lt;br&gt;image shape and resolution are re-read from the bot&#39;s fixed setting on every message" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="190" width="330" x="4610" y="4060" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="U-Jg9Jrtenf92Qa0-zKH-86" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#eef3fb;strokeColor=#3b5b8c;dashed=1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=4;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;" value="&lt;b&gt;Generating lock&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;While any run of this chat has unfinished jobs (read from the database, last 15 minutes only): a photo, any tap and any text, exit words included, get only the progress, &quot;Your catalogue is still generating (X of Y done). Please wait for it to finish.&quot; or &quot;Still generating: X of Y done.&quot;&lt;br&gt;Credits and help still answer&lt;br&gt;The lock lifts when the jobs finish, or after 15 minutes if they never do" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="205" width="330" x="5150" y="3680" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="U-Jg9Jrtenf92Qa0-zKH-79" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d7efec;strokeColor=#0f766e;fontSize=11;" value="start or entry" vertex="1">
